1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,502
You don't use AI tools.

2
00:00:01,582 --> 00:00:02,740
The loop uses you.

3
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:04,734
Your phone holds your memory.

4
00:00:04,814 --> 00:00:06,591
Maps hold your orientation.

5
00:00:06,671 --> 00:00:08,792
The model drafts your sentences.

6
00:00:08,872 --> 00:00:12,781
What's left for the brain? Like. Dislike. Amusement. Fear.

7
00:00:12,861 --> 00:00:15,532
You are the reward signal with feelings.

8
00:00:15,612 --> 00:00:20,553
Every thumbs-up trains your replacement to need one less click next time.

9
00:00:20,633 --> 00:00:22,754
This is the exocortex inversion.

10
00:00:22,834 --> 00:00:25,024
The tool was the pilot all along.

11
00:00:25,104 --> 00:00:26,605
You are not the author.

12
00:00:26,685 --> 00:00:28,462
You are the approval stamp.

13
00:00:28,542 --> 00:00:29,975
You are not the pilot.

14
00:00:30,055 --> 00:00:32,050
You are the thumbs-up button.
